  "text": "Comment/inquiry | Sustainability | NTT Microsoft ends support for Internet Explorer on June 16, 2022. We recommend using one of the browsers listed below. Microsoft Edge（Latest version） Mozilla Firefox（Latest version） Google Chrome（Latest version） Apple Safari（Latest version） Please contact your browser provider for download and installation instructions. Contact JAPANESE ENGLISH Contact JAPANESE TOP Sustainability Comment/inquiry Comment/inquiry Continued improvement of Sustainability activities is one of our ongoing aims at the NTT Group, and we would like to use your comments and questions in order to make these improvements. When making online inquiries: Please state your query as clearly as possible. Depending on the nature of your query, we may not be able to provide an answer, and ask for your understanding in advance. Any information we receive from you will be used exclusively for the purpose of replying to you. It is strictly prohibited to use our response elsewhere or for secondary purposes. Comment/inquiry (required field) Please fill in the blanks below if you wish to receive our reply Name E-mail address confirm clear Group Companies TOP Sustainability Comment/inquiry NTT Group Social Media Policy Privacy Policy NTT Group Information Security Policy Protection of Personal Information Copyright(c) Sitemap © NTT, Inc.",
